#Roman Numerals App

Print the Roman numeral representation of the integers 1 through 20.
This module is the executable entry point for the Roman project.

    main :: IO ()
    main = mapM_ (putStrLn . toRoman) [1..20]

~example
    toRoman 1    == "I"
    toRoman 2024 == "MMXXIV"

